<figure id="A7.T9" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>Retrieval results with different model architectures. Results are reported on the UIT-OpenViIC test set. EG-300M denotes EmbeddingGemma-300M. ViT-B/16 and ConvNeXt-base are pretrained with the DINOv3 framework. Integrating SIGROT consistently improves retrieval performance across all model architectures.</figcaption>
